  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "可可蘿",
    "words": "妳要不要先吃點東西？",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 105911
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "可可蘿",
    "words": "\\n雖然這裡的魔物不能吃，",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 105911
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "可可蘿",
    "words": "但我們可是【美食殿堂】……",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 105911
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "可可蘿",
    "words": "\\n光靠我們現有的食材",
    "voice": null,
    "unit_id": 105911
  },
  {
    "type": "dialogue",
    "name": "可可蘿",
    "words": "應該也能做出很好吃的東西才是。",
